    "body": {
      "dataStream": "Meeting Notes\rWrite during the meeting, not after. What goes unrecorded tends to become another meeting.\rDate and attendees\r\rAgenda\rThe points to cover, in order. Agreeing on this beforehand keeps the meeting from drifting.\rWhat was discussed\r\rDecisions made\rWhat was decided, and why. Writing down the reason saves you from re-arguing it later.\rTasks and owners\rEvery task with a name and a date. A task without an owner is not a task.\rNext meeting\r\r\n",
